1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,880
My mom tried my app.

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:01,600
She deleted her account.

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:02,280
That up?

4
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:03,360
She tapped sign up.

5
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,040
The page jumped.

6
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:04,820
She hit delete.

7
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:05,920
That's layout shift.

8
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,720
Stuff moves while the page loads.

9
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,380
And my landlord is her best friend.

10
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,220
Step one, put a width and height on every image.

11
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,440
The AI never did that.

12
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:14,420
It never does.

13
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,720
Step two, reserve space for banners and embeds.

14
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,380
Step three, match your fallback font size so the text doesn't jump.

15
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,520
And step four, never insert anything above what people are reading.

16
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,740
So she'll come back?

17
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,600
She's your mom.

18
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,380
She'll come back.

19
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,440
Strangers won't.

20
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,740
This stops the jumping.

21
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,260
It won't make them like the app.

22
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,520
Should I warn the landlord?

23
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:33,500
Warn nobody.

24
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,620
Comment the word jump.

25
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,520
I'll send the checklist.

